{"headword":"שָׁקַט","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb.</strong> be quiet, undisturbed <strong>(</strong>𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁקַט</span> (rare); NH <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁקט</span> is <em>sink down;</em> Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">سَقَطَ</span> is <em>drop down</em><strong>)</strong>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 ms. consec. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְשׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 30:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.30.10\">Je 30:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 46:27\" href=\"/Jeremiah.46.27\">46:27</a>, 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שָֽׁקְטָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 11:23\" href=\"/Joshua.11.23\">Jos 11:23</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁקָ֑טָה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 11:20\" href=\"/II_Kings.11.20\">2 K 11:20</a> +; 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁקַ֫טְתִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 3:26\" href=\"/Job.3.26\">Jb 3:26</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וְשָׁקַטְתִּ֫י</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:42\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.42\">Ez 16:42</a>; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִשְׁקֹט</span> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 3:18\" href=\"/Ruth.3.18\">Ru 3:18</a>; 2 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּשְׁקֹ֑טִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 47:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.47.6\">Je 47:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 47:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.47.7\">7</a>; 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶשְׁקוֹט</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 62:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.62.1\">Is 62:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 3:13\" href=\"/Job.3.13\">Jb 3:13</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אשׁקוטה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 18:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.18.4\">Is 18:4</a> Kt, Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶשָׁקֳטָה</span> (Ges<sup>§§ 10h, 48c</sup>); Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">שֹׁקֵט</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 18:7\" href=\"/Judges.18.7\">Ju 18:7</a> +, fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שֹׁקֶ֫טֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:40\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.40\">1 Ch 4:40</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שֹׁקָ֑טֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 1:11\" href=\"/Zechariah.1.11\">Zc 1:11</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַשֹּׁקְטִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 38:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.38.11\">Ez 38:11</a>;—<em>be quiet, undisturbed:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"of land, <em>at peace</em>, abs. <a data-ref=\"Judges 3:11\" href=\"/Judges.3.11\">Ju 3:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 3:30\" href=\"/Judges.3.30\">30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:31\" href=\"/Judges.5.31\">5:31</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:28\" href=\"/Judges.8.28\">8:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 14:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.14.7\">Is 14:7</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">נָ֫חָה</span>), <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 13:23\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.13.23\">2 Ch 13:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 14:5\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.14.5\">14:5</a>; + <span dir=\"rtl\">מִמִּלְחָמָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 11:23\" href=\"/Joshua.11.23\">Jos 11:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 14:15\" href=\"/Joshua.14.15\">14:15</a> (D?), cf. v <a data-ref=\"Joshua 14:5\" href=\"/Joshua.14.5\">5</a> (P); <span dir=\"rtl\">וּשְׁלֵוָה וְשׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:40\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.40\">1 Ch 4:40</a>; of earth <a data-ref=\"Psalms 76:9\" href=\"/Psalms.76.9\">ψ 76:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 1:11\" href=\"/Zechariah.1.11\">Zc 1:11</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(ישֶׁבֶת ושׁ׳)</span>; abs. of city <a data-ref=\"II Kings 11:20\" href=\"/II_Kings.11.20\">2 K 11:20</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 23:21\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.23.21\">2 Ch 23:21</a>, kingdom <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:30\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.30\">2 Ch 20:30</a>, + <span dir=\"rtl\">לִפְנֵי</span> pers. <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 14:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.14.4\">14:4</a>; of people, <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳ וּבֹטֵחַ</span> <em>in peace and security</em> <a data-ref=\"Judges 18:7\" href=\"/Judges.18.7\">Ju 18:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 18:27\" href=\"/Judges.18.27\">27</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הַשֹּׁקְטִים ישְׁבֵי לָבֶ֑טַח</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 38:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.38.11\">Ez 38:11</a>; + <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁאֲנַן</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 30:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.30.10\">Je 30:10</a> = <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 46:27\" href=\"/Jeremiah.46.27\">46:27</a>; of Moab, <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁאֲנַן</span> … <span dir=\"rtl\">וְשֹׁקִט אֶל־שְׁמָרָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.11\">48:11</a> <em>undisturbed upon its less</em> (fig. of wine); of Job, <em>quiet</em> in death <a data-ref=\"Job 3:13\" href=\"/Job.3.13\">Jb 3:13</a>, <em>be at rest</em> (from apprehensions of evil) v <a data-ref=\"Job 3:26\" href=\"/Job.3.26\">26</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁלַוְתִּי</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נָחְ֑תִּי</span>)."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>be quiet, inactive:</em> of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> + <span dir=\"rtl\">וְאַבִּיטָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 18:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.18.4\">Is 18:4</a> <em>I</em> will be <em>quiet and gaze</em>, i.e. gaze as an inactive spectator, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 83:2\" href=\"/Psalms.83.2\">ψ 83:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">דמה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חרשׁ</span> <em>be silent</em>); = be pacified <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:42\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.42\">Ez 16:42</a>; of sword of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 47:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.47.6\">Je 47:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 47:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.47.7\">7</a>; of Boaz <a data-ref=\"Ruth 3:18\" href=\"/Ruth.3.18\">Ru 3:18</a> <em>he will not be quiet</em> until he has finished the matter; of prophet <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 62:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.62.1\">Is 62:1</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חָשָׁה</span> <em>be silent</em>)."}],"num":"2."}],"form":"Qal"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יַשְׁקִיט</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.18\">Pr 15:18</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יַשְׁקִט</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 34:29\" href=\"/Job.34.29\">Jb 34:29</a>; Imv. ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַשְׁקֵט</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.4\">Is 7:4</a>; Inf. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">חַשְׁקֵט</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.17\">Is 32:17</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַשְׁקִיט</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 94:13\" href=\"/Psalms.94.13\">ψ 94:13</a>, -<span dir=\"rtl\">קִט</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 37:17\" href=\"/Job.37.17\">Jb 37:17</a>, -<span dir=\"rtl\">קֵט</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 57:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.57.20\">Is 57:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:23\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.23\">Je 49:23</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>shew quietness</em> (inner causat.), of men <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.4\">Is 7:4</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">אַל־תִּירָא</span>), of sea <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 57:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.57.20\">Is 57:20</a> = <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:23\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.23\">Je 49:23</a>, earth <a data-ref=\"Job 37:17\" href=\"/Job.37.17\">Jb 37:17</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">מִדָּרוֹם</span>); hence Inf. abs. = subst., <em>quietness, display of quietness</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.15\">Is 30:15</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲבֹדַת הַצְּדָקָה הַשְׁקֵט וָבֶ֫טַח</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.17\">32:17</a> <em>the product of righteousness is quietness and security</em> (Du Che<sup>Hpt</sup> Marti del. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַצּ׳</span> as dittogr. from v a, read <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמִּשְׁפָּט</span> for <span dir=\"rtl\">הַשְׁקֵט</span>, and del. <span dir=\"rtl\">וָ</span>: <em>the product of justice is security</em>); (<em>presumptuous</em>) <em>security</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁלְוַת הַשְׁקֵט</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:49\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.49\">Ez 16:49</a> (of Sodom)."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>cause quietness:</em> subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 34:29\" href=\"/Job.34.29\">Jb 34:29</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לְהַשְׁקִיט לוֹ מִימֵי רָ֑ע</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 94:13\" href=\"/Psalms.94.13\">ψ 94:13</a>; <em>pacify, allay</em>, obj. <span dir=\"rtl\">רִיב</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.18\">Pr 15:18</a>."}],"num":"2."}],"form":"Hiph."}]},"rid":"BDB10580","strong_numbers":["8252"],"next_hw":"שֶׁ֫קֶט","prev_hw":"מַשְׁקֶה³","all_cited":true,"root":true,"quotes":[],"